{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>A horror story that could happen to anyone.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strangers who might show up at your door.<br>Choices you\u2019ll have to make.<br>A truth that\u2019s hard to accept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This short psychological visual novel is more about perception than traditional storytelling. Every choice shapes your destination. Every detail is intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/DescriptionScreenshot_Eng_1.jpg?t=1749134665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Story</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young couple moves into a new apartment after their wedding - but the husband leaves on a business trip right away, leaving his wife alone. Not the best honeymoon, to say the least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that\u2019s not the only problem that has fallen on their shoulders - a strange woman has started to visit the apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loneliness, confusion, and anxiety\u2014this is how the story begins. Your decisions will shape what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But some things are beyond your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/DescriptionScreenshot_Eng_2.jpg?t=1749134665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 endings for the main storyline and 2 for the side plot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choices that encourage introspection;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark, atmospheric visual style;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single playthrough takes 20-35 minutes, but it may take more than one playthrough to understand the story fully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515690?t=1749134665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515690?t=1749134665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/5ecd643e253d34725f240d75fd784c8cf2a2f3a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749134665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/5ecd643e253d34725f240d75fd784c8cf2a2f3a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749134665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence: the character engages in aggressive actions, resulting in injury with visible bleeding."},"demos":[{"appid":3651290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>A horror story that could happen to anyone.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strangers who might show up at your door.<br>Choices you\u2019ll have to make.<br>A truth that\u2019s hard to accept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This short psychological visual novel is more about perception than traditional storytelling. Every choice shapes your destination. Every detail is intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/DescriptionScreenshot_Eng_1.jpg?t=1749134665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Story</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young couple moves into a new apartment after their wedding - but the husband leaves on a business trip right away, leaving his wife alone. Not the best honeymoon, to say the least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that\u2019s not the only problem that has fallen on their shoulders - a strange woman has started to visit the apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loneliness, confusion, and anxiety\u2014this is how the story begins. Your decisions will shape what happens next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But some things are beyond your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/extras/DescriptionScreenshot_Eng_2.jpg?t=1749134665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Features</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 endings for the main storyline and 2 for the side plot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choices that encourage introspection;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dark, atmospheric visual style;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single playthrough takes 20-35 minutes, but it may take more than one playthrough to understand the story fully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Right Hand Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/5b25c3bf7e632862ff0f33b1b0defa0754a5edba/header.jpg?t=1749134665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139294,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139294/movie480.mp4?t=1747155174","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139294/movie_max.mp4?t=1747155174"},"name":"Invisible Wall Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139294/f3a5e2bf2ce83fcff16bd7ad18445b566556bea9/movie_